I was finally able to get some more details on the problems with my PC164.
It seems that the PCI bus isn't putting anything on the +5v or -5v lines,
possibly indicating a blown voltage regulator somewhere.

Anyway, having been bitten on Ebay two out of the last three times I've
successfully bid on things, I'd much rather see if someone here on the
list has a board they're interested in selling.  I guess I'd specifically
be interested in PC164, PC164LX, PC164SX boards, but I'd even consider
full systems as long as they're 21164 based or better.

If you have anything like that you'd be willing to sell, please email me
privately.

Thanks,
Mike
