On Sun, Dec 17, 2000 at 07:03:04AM -0500, MCGWIER ROBERT wrote:
> 
> I still have this problem on my Alpha SX164
> and have had for almost a year now.  I have gone
> through every possible iteration of /etc/svc.conf,
> etc. etc. etc.  It is really driving me banana's
> and I am desperately hoping that upgrading
