I means that in /etc you did not run this command:

  ln -s Tsunami alpha_systype

I think that I got this order right.  This is from, fallible, memory.
Do not worry that 'Tsunami' file does not exist.

> Is the compilation somehow  messed up? 

Not at all.  Your version of library is not guessing correctly
a type of your motherboard and you have to help it a bit.

